  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KOW Lifestyle Footwear USA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kingdom of WOW produces footwear and is a social brand with an in-house and responsibly run manufacturing facility. This DGGF-TA supports market entry in the USA for KOW. KOW produces shoes in Cambodia. This DGGF-TA has supported the employment of 12, mainly uneducated, women who usually have little chance to find safe and fair employment in the formal economy. The company provides skills training to the women, as well as trainings on healthcare and labour rights. 15 people were indirectly supported by the US production. After the end of the project, sales will lead to an additional 6 FTEs within the company. The company is investing in sustainability and has decided to buy wool-bamboo blends instead of (non-biodegradable) acrylic-wool blends.</narrative>
  </description>
